&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Formal UKG administrator training or certification for UKG Pro or UKG Ready.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with additional UKG modules, such as onboarding or Manager Self Service business processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience authoring reports in UKG BI (Cognos), Google Sheets, and Excel.&lt;/li&gt;
