&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, and maintain automation frameworks (Playwright, Python, Jest, API automation) that provide comprehensive, reliable test coverage across ID.me&#39;s services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop end-to-end and integration testing strategies for complex, asynchronous, event-driven, and eventually-consistent systems, including workflow orchestration platforms such as Temporal.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and champion testing-in-production practices – canary deployments, progressive/phased rollouts, synthetic monitoring, and automated rollback triggers – to validate real-world behavior safely before full release.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own security-focused test automation covering authentication/authorization flows (OAuth 2.0, OIDC), RBAC/ReBAC, secrets management, and tenant isolation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate automated testing into CI/CD pipelines (e.g., GitHub Actions) to give teams fast, reliable feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply AI tools to accelerate test authoring, test plan generation, and code review – modeling AI-first engineering practices for the team and helping less-technical stakeholders adopt AI safely.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with development teams as a testing strategist, advising on testable code structure, coverage gaps, and quality checks throughout the development lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Debug and root-cause issues across frontend, backend, APIs, and distributed services, and drive fixes to closure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and track reliability metrics (e.g., time to detect, time to remediate) for the systems you test.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
