&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience (or equivalent: 6+ years with a Master&#39;s degree, or a PhD with 3+ years) as a software engineer&amp;nbsp; in modern web applications and distributed systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Python/TypeScript/JavaScript/Java&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with Playwright, Jest, and API automation.&lt;/li&gt;
