&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills, with experience influencing technical direction across engineering, product, finance, and security stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience at scale designing and owning event driven architecture using technologies such as Kafka, Pub/Sub, SNS/SQS, Debezium, or similar, where accuracy and auditability are non-negotiable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
